<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'><span style="mso-spacerun:yes">   </span>Gm<o:p></o:p></span></p>
<p class="MsoNormal" style="mso-layout-grid-align:none;text-autospace:none"><span style='font-size:10.0pt;font-family:"Courier New";color:black'>Подай
